OL,3,GNEWSACaroline Glachan murderer Donna
OL,4,ABrand dies in hospital
OL,5,
OL,6,FA woman serving a life sentence for the
OL,7,Fmurder of a teenager 30 years ago has
OL,8,Fdied in hospital.
OL,10,FDonna Marie Brand was found guilty of
OL,11,Fmurdering 14-year-old Caroline Glachan
OL,12,Fat Renton in Dunbartonshire in 1996.
OL,14,FBrand and co-accused Robert O'Brien and
OL,15,FAndrew Kelly were convicted in 2023
OL,16,Fafter the evidence in the case was
OL,17,Fre-examined in 2019.
OL,19,FBrand, who was 47, died at Forth Valley
OL,20,FHospital on Wednesday.
OL,23,APub: 27-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
